---
title: gnocchi, sundried tomato & white bean soup
servings: 2
prep-time: 15 minutes
cook-time: 25 minutes
source: https://www.instagram.com/reel/DQDKgoRkkDi/
tags: [vegetarian, gnocchi, soup, cannellini beans]
image: https://scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/568542474_17897719389299937_2424669596917079926_n.jpg?stp=cmp1_dst-jpg_e35_s640x640_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=8c0ds33fI8gQ7kNvwGx8RjF&_nc_oc=AdkCnHRN4NcFUiISciF1IMF72TGSiMHI3RT7ziZO9S5zd4iOjozif_wA13IPPmJJhNQ&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=9LIhzzBB2F3JJWcx7zzWzA&oh=00_AfnGZ-TUx_3ce5hCix0oDarhQgsCRjpDa7XGkKEa_Z9wow&oe=6951FCF5
---

Prepare your veggies by dicing the onion, finely chopping the carrots and celery, and mincing the garlic.

To a #large pot{} on medium heat, add @olive oil{1%tbsp}, then throw in @onion{1%large}, @carrots{2%medium-large}, and @celery{3-4%stalks} and sauté for a few minutes. Add in @garlic{4-5%cloves}, @italian seasoning{1%tbsp}, @salt{1/2%tsp}, and @pepper{1/4%tsp} and stir well, cooking for another few minutes.

Add in @vegetable stock{5%cups}, then cover and bring to a simmer.

Once simmering, add @gnocchi{500%g}. Next, add in @cannellini beans{1%can}, drained and rinsed.

Roughly chop @greens{2.5%cups} and @cilantro{0.75%cup} and add them in, covering for ~{2%minutes} to soften.

Finally, add in @coconut milk{0.75%cup} and @sundried tomatoes{0.5%cup} and stir well.

Serve immediately and enjoy.